Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.208 --> 00:00:01.128
- It's the kind of wine that

00:00:01.128 --> 00:00:02.748
makes you drunk before you realize it.

00:00:05.978 --> 00:00:07.572
- I don't think I've ever
had American champagne.

00:00:07.572 --> 00:00:11.432
- My expectations are
just like everything else

00:00:11.432 --> 00:00:15.072
more processed, family
friendly version of the drink.

00:00:15.072 --> 00:00:16.852
- Fast and processed.

00:00:16.852 --> 00:00:18.412
- Fast and processed.

00:00:18.412 --> 00:00:20.592
- It just tastes like Alcohol with bubbles

00:00:20.592 --> 00:00:22.132
and a little bit like champagne.

00:00:22.132 --> 00:00:23.802
- I've had some really nice one,

00:00:23.802 --> 00:00:25.952
but the complexity of the taste

00:00:25.952 --> 00:00:28.312
is not as developed as it is with

00:00:28.312 --> 00:00:29.632
European wines.

00:00:29.632 --> 00:00:30.752
Especially, French.

00:00:33.152 --> 00:00:35.012
- I do have to say it is a crime

00:00:35.012 --> 00:00:36.742
to drink champagne

00:00:36.742 --> 00:00:38.912
in anything else that's not a flute.

00:00:38.912 --> 00:00:40.652
- To me it looks to bubbly.

00:00:40.652 --> 00:00:42.392
- It look like an apple juice with bubble.

00:00:42.392 --> 00:00:44.432
- Right off the bat it
smells like white wine.

00:00:44.432 --> 00:00:46.212
- The color is pretty nice.

00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:48.272
It's not to yellow, to sugary,

00:00:48.272 --> 00:00:49.552
and it's not to clear,

00:00:49.552 --> 00:00:51.742
but you would feel it's sparkling water.

00:00:51.742 --> 00:00:52.772
- Should we go for it?

00:00:52.772 --> 00:00:54.012
- Ok, lets try it.

00:00:54.012 --> 00:00:54.762
- (French word)
- (French word)

00:00:57.692 --> 00:00:58.532
- Yea, white wine.

00:00:58.532 --> 00:01:00.020
White wine with bubbles.

00:01:00.020 --> 00:01:00.780
- It's sweet.

00:01:00.780 --> 00:01:02.150
It's bubbly.
- Mm Hm

00:01:02.150 --> 00:01:03.430
You can feel it in your tongue.

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:04.770
- Really sugary.

00:01:04.770 --> 00:01:06.250
- (laughs) Yea

00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:07.690
- I mean, I'd still drink it.

00:01:07.690 --> 00:01:08.930
- (laughs) Alright, here you go.

00:01:08.930 --> 00:01:10.850
- It remind me of
champormene a little bit.

00:01:10.850 --> 00:01:12.250
- Champormene, that's
exactly what we have.

00:01:12.250 --> 00:01:13.250
- Yeah

00:01:13.250 --> 00:01:14.730
- Which is for kids.
It's like a apple juice

00:01:14.730 --> 00:01:15.750
with bubbles.

00:01:15.750 --> 00:01:16.890
- But no alcohol.
- It tastes a little bit

00:01:16.890 --> 00:01:17.720
like that.

00:01:17.720 --> 00:01:19.230
But you can tell there's alcohol in here.

00:01:19.230 --> 00:01:20.690
(bell ding)

00:01:22.840 --> 00:01:24.700
- It's not bad, bad.

00:01:24.700 --> 00:01:26.630
It's just not as good.

00:01:26.630 --> 00:01:29.350
- And I can feel the
alcohol a little bit more.

00:01:29.350 --> 00:01:32.670
I think because it's not a
sweet as the previous one.

00:01:32.670 --> 00:01:34.510
- I would rather have this with a meal,

00:01:34.510 --> 00:01:35.070
- Yea.

00:01:35.070 --> 00:01:36.690
but I'd rather have the
fruity one at a party.

00:01:36.690 --> 00:01:38.110
- The textures not as strong

00:01:38.110 --> 00:01:39.730
so it's something that you could drink

00:01:39.730 --> 00:01:41.950
in larger amounts instead of enjoy.

00:01:41.950 --> 00:01:42.770
- This is not bad.

00:01:42.770 --> 00:01:43.950
I'd pay for that.

00:01:46.190 --> 00:01:48.090
- I recommend the Santa
Monica California Champagne.

00:01:48.090 --> 00:01:48.990
- Yes.

00:01:48.990 --> 00:01:49.810
- Because it is good.

00:01:49.810 --> 00:01:51.210
But, the first one more for parties.

00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:53.050
- It showed that there
were different options.

00:01:53.050 --> 00:01:53.990
Some a bit more sweet.

00:01:53.990 --> 00:01:55.110
Some a bit more dry.

00:01:55.110 --> 00:01:56.090
- We wouldn't buy it.

00:01:56.090 --> 00:01:59.030
We would only drink it if given to us.

00:01:59.030 --> 00:02:00.330
- You can find good ones,

00:02:00.330 --> 00:02:02.370
good American champagnes.

00:02:02.370 --> 00:02:05.640
You can't expect it to
taste like French champagne.

00:02:05.640 --> 00:02:07.810
